 "meta": {
  "id": "5275b718b941e5dd02f127478a236ed4",
  "name": {
   "zh": "重力估算 · GeoCalib",
   "en": "Gravity Estimate · GeoCalib"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "GeoCalib 官方自述：单图标定，只从一张画面估计摄影机内参和重力方向，做法是几何优化与深度学习结合。这张卡把它的重力方向接到「自动落地」，把 Pi3 解出的摄影机和点云转正；「地面依据」选「点云里最密的一层」时再落到 y = 0。GeoCalib 本身可商用；卡上解摄影机用的 Pi3 非商用，所以整张卡标为非商用。",
   "en": "GeoCalib calibrates a single image, estimating camera intrinsics and the gravity direction by combining geometric optimization with deep learning. This card feeds its gravity to Auto Ground to straighten the camera and point cloud solved by Pi3; with Ground From set to \"Densest Layer of the Point Cloud\" it also grounds at y = 0. GeoCalib allows commercial use, but the Pi3 solve does not, so the card is non-commercial."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-13T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "lens_calib",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
